      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i literally don't even exist anymore. like i woke up today and everyone i thought i knew just... stopped. no texts, no tags, nothing. it's like they all just collectively decided to delete me from their lives. i'm just staring at my phone and it’s just empty. i feel like a ghost walking around in a world that already moved on without me.",
