      "content": "\"let go and move on\"... what does that even mean? it feels more like i've already been moved on from. it's not just a phase, it's like they all just scrubbed me out. it's so quiet. it's like there's no point in even trying to be \"seen\" anymore if nobody is looking. i'm just kind of drifting.",
